      "html": "<p>(19 Dec 2007) For the first time Aquarium Glaser was able to import this barb, which is quite unnoticeable at first sight. The peaceful animals turn out to be very colourful if you look closely. Especially the pale yellow shiny tail is extremely attractive, which gave rise to the name \"Goldtailed Tinfoil Barb\".</p><p>(Photo &amp; Text F. Schäfer)</p>"
